  "reference": "Psalms 85",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "85",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 85"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "85",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician, A Psalm for the sons of Korah.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 85:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.85.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.85.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", thou hast been favourable unto thy land: thou hast brought back the captivity of Jacob.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 85:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast forgiven the iniquity of thy people, thou hast covered all their sin. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 85:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast taken away all thy wrath: thou hast turned",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thyself",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.85.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.85.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from the fierceness of thine anger.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 85:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turn us, O God of our salvation, and cause thine anger toward us to cease.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 85:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wilt thou be angry with us for ever? wilt thou draw out thine anger to all generations?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 85:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wilt thou not revive us again: that thy people may rejoice in thee?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 85:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shew us thy mercy, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.85.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.85.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and grant us thy salvation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 85:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will hear what God the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.85.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.85.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will speak: for he will speak peace unto his people, and to his saints: but let them not turn again to folly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 85:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Surely his salvation",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.85.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.85.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nigh them that fear him; that glory may dwell in our land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 85:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mercy and truth are met together; righteousness and peace have kissed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "each other",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.85.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.85.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 85:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Truth shall spring out of the earth; and righteousness shall look down from heaven.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 85:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.85.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.85.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall give",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that which is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.85.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.85.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "good; and our land shall yield her increase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 85:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Righteousness shall go before him; and shall set",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "us",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.85.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.85.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the way of his steps.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.85.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.85.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.86",
    "number": "86",
